WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.604
Your spreadsheet already contains useful work. Bring it

00:00:03.604 --> 00:00:06.858
into VANTAGE with the source and the review

00:00:06.858 --> 00:00:07.672
steps intact.

00:00:08.072 --> 00:00:11.221
Open the queue and choose Import a spreadsheet.

00:00:11.221 --> 00:00:14.370
Select your file, then review the sheet and

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:15.945
fields VANTAGE will use.

00:00:16.345 --> 00:00:19.733
Match the fields carefully. Check the identifiers, amounts,

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:23.122
and units. A preview is the time to

00:00:23.122 --> 00:00:26.510
catch a column that would otherwise mean something

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:26.934
different.

00:00:27.334 --> 00:00:30.607
Read the validation message before applying anything. Correct

00:00:30.607 --> 00:00:33.880
the issue and preview again. The counts and

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:37.153
sample rows should match what you intend to

00:00:37.153 --> 00:00:37.971
bring in.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:41.235
Apply the reviewed import. Open a work item

00:00:41.235 --> 00:00:44.100
and inspect its source so you can confirm

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.890
where the row came from.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:50.018
Reimport the same unchanged file and inspect the

00:00:50.018 --> 00:00:53.747
result. This example should produce no duplicate work.

00:00:53.747 --> 00:00:57.475
A changed file is a different case and

00:00:57.475 --> 00:00:58.873
deserves another review.
